  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1908\">\n<p data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1825\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">**Normal Metabolizer (NM, <em data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1823\">1/<em data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1822\">1):</em></em></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1908\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1908\">\n<p data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1908\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Expected normal activation of clopidogrel &rarr; <strong data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1905\">Standard dosing (75 mg/day)</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"2109\">\n<p data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1962\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">**Intermediate Metabolizer (IM, *1/*2, <em data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1960\">1/<em data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1959\">3):</em></em></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2109\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2109\">\n<p data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2109\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"1989\">Reduced activation</strong> &rarr; May need <strong data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2053\">alternative antiplatelet (prasugrel, ticagrelor)</strong>, especially in high-risk patients (e.g., post-stent).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2262\">\n<p data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2155\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">**Poor Metabolizer (PM, *2/*2, <em data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2153\">2/<em data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2152\">3):</em></em></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2262\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2262\">\n<p data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2262\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2194\">Significant loss of activation</strong> &rarr; <strong data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2259\">Clopidogrel may be ineffective; switch therapy recommended</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2425\">\n<p data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2331\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">**Rapid / Ultra-Rapid Metabolizer (RM/UM, *1/*17 or <em data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2329\">17/<em data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2328\">17):</em></em></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2425\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2425\">\n<p data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2425\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">May have <strong data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2387\">enhanced drug effect and bleeding risk</strong>; dose adjustment may be considered.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2525\">\n<p data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2525\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Always integrate with <strong data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2522\">platelet function tests, clinical status, and cardiologist guidance</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
